    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0000_system_01a",
      "hash64": "E5926B1F93F15D72",
      "text": "私立橘子学院",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0000_system_01b",
      "hash64": "E5926A1F93F15BBF",
      "text": "私立葡萄学院",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0000_system_02a",
      "hash64": "E595931F93F3D741",
      "text": "师从传统\\n茁壮成长",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0000_system_02b",
      "hash64": "E595901F93F3D228",
      "text": "尊重个性\\n开拓未来",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0000_system_03",
      "hash64": "3D3365D649E7430D",
      "text": "来吧，欢迎你也来到\\n宝可梦的世界！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0000_system_04a",
      "hash64": "E5816F1F93E2F10B",
      "text": "橘子学院校长\\n克拉韦尔",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0000_system_04b",
      "hash64": "E581701F93E2F2BE",
      "text": "葡萄学院校长\\n克拉韦尔",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0000_system_05",
      "hash64": "3D335FD649E738DB",
      "text": "帕底亚地区是一个与自然为伴，\\n土地十分丰饶的地方。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0000_system_06",
      "hash64": "3D3360D649E73A8E",
      "text": "这里生活着许多\\n被称为“宝可梦”的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0000_system_06_2",
      "hash64": "EFA74DA854D19FE3",
      "text": "不可思议的生物。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0000_system_07",
      "hash64": "3D3361D649E73C41",
      "text": "大海、天空、城镇……\\n到处都是宝可梦的家园。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0000_system_08",
      "hash64": "3D335AD649E7305C",
      "text": "我们人类和它们互相帮助，\\n生活在一起。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0000_system_09a",
      "hash64": "E5777B1F93DAB0EA",
      "text": "在橘子学院，\\n为了进一步加深对宝可梦的理解……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0000_system_09b",
      "hash64": "E5777A1F93DAAF37",
      "text": "在葡萄学院，\\n为了进一步加深对宝可梦的理解……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0000_system_10",
      "hash64": "3D3668D649E97DFD",
      "text": "人们从各种各样的地方聚集而来。\\n大家会互相学习……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0000_system_11",
      "hash64": "3D3667D649E97C4A",
      "text": "还会作为宝可梦训练家\\n指挥宝可梦对战，共同进步。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0000_system_12",
      "hash64": "3D3666D649E97A97",
      "text": "我们会通过各式各样的教学，\\n激发出学生潜在的可能性。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0000_system_13",
      "hash64": "3D3665D649E978E4",
      "text": "在这里，你会结识伙伴，\\n邂逅宝可梦，并发现新的自己……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0000_system_14a",
      "hash64": "ECE4A81F97B5BCF0",
      "text": "我们衷心期待\\n大家能来橘子学院学习。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0000_system_14b",
      "hash64": "ECE4AB1F97B5C209",
      "text": "我们衷心期待\\n大家能来葡萄学院学习。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
